  "sourceTitle": "Quanto: a PyTorch quantization backend for Optimum",
  "sourceBodyHash": "348bb4df710172fd88a43dd421c3c34a0fcf085629ee224c76005e8c3508a2f2",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-CN",
  "translationVersion": "openrouter-zh-v2",
  "status": "complete",
  "importanceLevel": 4,
  "provider": "nowcoding",
  "requestedModel": "gpt-6.1-sol",
  "model": "gpt-6.1-sol",
  "createdAt": "2026-10-17T21:10:34.482464Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-10-18T03:17:17.768613Z",
  "totalBlocks": 56,
  "translatedBlocks": 56,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d5591fcbdd29c3c2",
      "translationZh": "量化是一种通过使用低精度数据类型（如 8 位整数（int8））而非常用的 32 位浮点数（float32）来表示深度学习模型的权重和激活值，从而降低模型求值所需计算和内存开销的技术。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "144b213aab91c01c",
      "translationZh": "减少位数意味着得到的模型所需的存储空间更少，这对于在消费级设备上部署大型语言模型至关重要。它还支持针对较低位宽数据类型的特定优化，例如在 CUDA 设备上进行 int8 或 float8 矩阵乘法。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1f1f33ea5d39f4fa",
      "translationZh": "目前有许多开源库可用于量化 pytorch 深度学习模型，每个库都提供了非常强大的功能，但往往仅适用于特定的模型配置和设备。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "89f92fd193cb5271",
      "translationZh": "此外，尽管它们基于相同的设计原则，但遗憾的是，它们往往互不兼容。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5ef673854f10cb59",
      "translationZh": "今天，我们很高兴地推出 quanto，这是一个面向 Optimum 的 PyTorch 量化后端。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5fa05d96d7294826",
      "translationZh": "它在设计时充分考虑了通用性和简洁性：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0a41928358bd1b87",
      "translationZh": "所有功能均可在即时执行模式下使用（适用于无法追踪的模型），",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "bd9635de245699a8",
      "translationZh": "量化后的模型可以放置在任何设备上（包括 CUDA 和 MPS），",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c146ff24a7477afd",
      "translationZh": "自动插入量化和反量化桩模块，",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "879c42f6441a8b3f",
      "translationZh": "自动插入量化函数式运算，",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0bd103dd938d394d",
      "translationZh": "自动插入量化模块（支持的模块列表见下文），",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "39130092626b8b39",
      "translationZh": "提供从浮点模型到动态量化模型，再到静态量化模型的无缝工作流程，",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1f8132e22e94dd16",
      "translationZh": "序列化兼容 PyTorch weight_only 和 🤗 Safetensors，",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f5b22e932d09bf5e",
      "translationZh": "在 CUDA 设备上加速矩阵乘法（int8-int8、fp16-int4、bf16-int8、bf16-int4），",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e01106bb429abd84",
      "translationZh": "支持 int2、int4、int8 和 float8 权重，",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ed3d04f42638c995",
      "translationZh": "支持 int8 和 float8 激活值。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "328866b268e56308",
      "translationZh": "近期的量化方法似乎主要关注对大语言模型（LLMs）进行量化，而 quanto 旨在为简单的量化方案（线性量化、分组量化）提供极其简单的量化原语，使其能够适用于任何模态。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "9ebb4a2b74d07d3f",
      "translationZh": "量化工作流程",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9f22daff82717788",
      "translationZh": "Quanto 以 pip 包的形式提供。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "389d6ade5360296b",
      "translationZh": "典型的量化工作流程包括以下步骤：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8edc03fa13c9ed0d",
      "translationZh": "1. 量化",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "afc299df22febbd0",
      "translationZh": "第一步将标准浮点模型转换为动态量化模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1163c1019039fc1d",
      "translationZh": "在此阶段，仅修改模型的推理过程，以动态量化权重。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bce012f8284f9232",
      "translationZh": "2. 校准（如果不对激活值进行量化，则此步骤为可选）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4196adbb76c98c19",
      "translationZh": "Quanto 支持一种校准模式，可在将代表性样本输入量化模型时记录激活值的范围。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9efeb3109de0efd3",
      "translationZh": "这会自动启用量化模块中的激活值量化。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4b084a8008d43bcd",
      "translationZh": "3. 微调，也称为量化感知训练（可选）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ff96386ad8c573d3",
      "translationZh": "如果模型性能下降过多，可以对其微调几个训练轮次，以恢复浮点模型的性能。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "76936b14315af506",
      "translationZh": "4. 冻结整数权重",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "494967c6d3611fad",
      "translationZh": "冻结模型时，其浮点权重会被替换为量化权重。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a5333ed710a48947",
      "translationZh": "5. 序列化量化模型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "65a56596807aba4c",
      "translationZh": "量化模型的权重可以序列化为 state_dict，并保存到文件中。同时支持 pickle 和 safetensors（推荐）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7d55d109df63691d",
      "translationZh": "为了重新加载这些权重，你还需要保存量化模型的量化映射。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f8609f1eadaa33b3",
      "translationZh": "5. 重新加载量化模型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4501cdb64ff5d03d",
      "translationZh": "可以使用 requantize 辅助函数，从 state_dict 和 quantization_map 重新加载已序列化的量化模型。请注意，你需要先实例化一个空模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "234bcaeae597fa76",
      "translationZh": "有关量化工作流的具体实例，请参阅示例。你也可以查看这个 notebook，其中我们展示了如何使用 quanto 量化 BLOOM 模型！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "442aded87a55aa8c",
      "translationZh": "性能",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3d2cec331f7c81b5",
      "translationZh": "下面两张图评估了 meta-llama/Meta-Llama-3.1-8B 在不同量化配置下的准确率。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8fb1f9d1924931d2",
      "translationZh": "注意：每组中的第一个柱条始终对应未量化的模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "68c9367b6a780387",
      "translationZh": "这些结果是在未应用任何训练后优化（Post-Training-Optimization）算法（如 hqq 或 AWQ）的情况下获得的。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "88632eb766cabdb8",
      "translationZh": "下图展示了在 NVIDIA A10 GPU 上测得的每个 token 的延迟。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "99bd4d46bdf20d3d",
      "translationZh": "敬请关注更新后的结果，我们正在不断通过优化器和优化后的内核改进 quanto。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "33a55841f243be67",
      "translationZh": "有关不同模型架构和配置的详细结果，请参阅 quanto 基准测试。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "c7238d15300448f7",
      "translationZh": "在 transformers 中的集成",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f33872f25f25905b",
      "translationZh": "Quanto 已无缝集成到 Hugging Face transformers 库中。只需向 from_pretrained 传入 QuantoConfig，即可量化任意模型！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3db33c122ce47c37",
      "translationZh": "目前，你需要使用最新版本的 accelerate，以确保该集成完全兼容。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d73fcc5fb125a5e6",
      "translationZh": "只需在 QuantoConfig 中传入正确的参数，即可将权重和/或激活值量化为 int8、float8、int4 或 int2。激活值可以采用 int8 或 float8。对于 float8，你需要具备兼容 float8 精度的硬件，否则，在执行 matmul 时，quanto 会在不发出提示的情况下将权重和激活值向上转换为 torch.float32 或 torch.float16（取决于模型的原始数据类型），此行为仅在权重被量化时发生。如果你尝试在 MPS 设备上使用 float8，torch 目前会报错。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "624c41b196c2c155",
      "translationZh": "Quanto 与设备无关，这意味着无论使用 CPU/GPU/ MPS（Apple Silicon），你都可以量化并运行模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "519ec3edfc0aa184",
      "translationZh": "Quanto 也能很好地兼容 torch.compile。你可以使用 quanto 量化模型，然后对模型调用 torch.compile 进行编译，以加快生成速度。如果涉及动态量化（即量化感知训练或启用了激活量化），这项功能可能无法开箱即用。如果你使用 transformers 集成，请确保在创建 QuantoConfig 时保持 activations=None。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1959809ac5f1c367",
      "translationZh": "使用 quanto 还可以量化任何模型，无论其模态如何！我们将演示如何使用 quanto 将 openai/whisper-large-v3 模型量化为 int8。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0051",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ffd0a05620409e49",
      "translationZh": "查看这个 notebook，获取关于如何通过 transformers 集成正确使用 quanto 的完整教程！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "84e4c52ceaf3fd29",
      "translationZh": "为 quanto 做贡献",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0053",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "90962866caa2b372",
      "translationZh": "非常欢迎为 quanto 做出贡献，尤其是在以下领域：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0054",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "6250c54c3280229d",
      "translationZh": "针对特定设备、为 quanto 运算优化的内核，",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0055",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ffc8d3bdc9a4a39c",
      "translationZh": "用于恢复量化过程中损失的精度的训练后量化优化器，",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0056",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "34eecf6384610dc9",
      "translationZh": "适用于 transformers 或 diffusers 模型的辅助类。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
  "wordWise": [
    {
      "term": "Quantization",
      "briefZh": "量化",
      "explanationZh": "用较低精度的数据类型表示模型中的数值，以降低计算和内存开销。"
    },
    {
      "term": "weights and activations",
      "briefZh": "权重与激活值",
      "explanationZh": "分别指模型学习到的参数，以及模型在计算过程中产生的激活数值。"
    },
    {
      "term": "bitwidth",
      "briefZh": "位宽",
      "explanationZh": "表示一个数值所使用的二进制位数；位宽越低，通常所需存储空间越少。"
    },
    {
      "term": "matrix multiplications",
      "briefZh": "矩阵乘法",
      "explanationZh": "深度学习中的核心计算操作，文中指 CUDA 设备上针对 int8 或 float8 的矩阵乘法。"
    },
    {
      "term": "quantization backend",
      "briefZh": "量化后端",
      "explanationZh": "为上层工具提供模型量化相关功能的底层实现。"
    },
    {
      "term": "eager mode",
      "briefZh": "即时执行模式",
      "explanationZh": "直接执行模型运算的模式，不要求先通过追踪生成计算图。"
    },
    {
      "term": "non-traceable models",
      "briefZh": "不可追踪模型",
      "explanationZh": "无法通过追踪执行过程来构建计算图的模型。"
    },
    {
      "term": "dequantization stubs",
      "briefZh": "反量化桩模块",
      "explanationZh": "在模型中标记或执行从量化表示转换回浮点表示的占位模块。"
    },
    {
      "term": "functional operations",
      "briefZh": "函数式运算",
      "explanationZh": "以函数形式而非独立模块形式表达的模型运算。"
    },
    {
      "term": "serialization",
      "briefZh": "序列化",
      "explanationZh": "将模型权重等数据转换为可保存和加载的格式。"
    },
    {
      "term": "weights",
      "briefZh": "权重",
      "explanationZh": "模型通过训练获得的参数，此处支持多种整数和浮点精度表示。"
    },
    {
      "term": "activations",
      "briefZh": "激活值",
      "explanationZh": "模型运算过程中产生的中间数值，此处支持 int8 和 float8 表示。"
    },
    {
      "term": "quantization primitives",
      "briefZh": "量化原语",
      "explanationZh": "用于构建量化方案的基础操作。"
    },
    {
      "term": "linear quantization",
      "briefZh": "线性量化",
      "explanationZh": "通过线性映射将浮点数转换为低精度数值的量化方法。"
    },
    {
